#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:3773 package/contents/ui/main.qml:3874
#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:3941 package/contents/ui/main.qml:3948
#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:4001 package/contents/ui/main.qml:4004
